Spec: Portable explicit connection request

Purpose:
  Validate public target references and a policy bounded by an independently approved import.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionOpenRequest.java

References:
  /docs/adr/0023-connection-request-policy.md
  ./ManifestContract.sdd

Must:
  Match the .NET request fields, strict `16 KiB` input boundary, UUID normalization and exact policy narrowing semantics.
  Reject unknown/caller/address fields and malformed identifiers with fixed @ContractException errors.
  Keep all parsed fields immutable and perform no storage, authority lookup or networking.
